Reserved for Base UI component source — the `base` behaviour variant.

This folder proves the base axis exists before there is a second base to put
in it. `registry/bases/<base>/<component>.tsx` is where a built component will
live, and `scripts/build-registry.mts` walks this tree to produce
registry/__index__.ts. Adding a second base is a sibling folder here and a
string in REGISTRY_BASES — never a URL migration. Delete this file when the
first component lands.
